
### ============================================================
### EXERCISE 51 - BOOK CRUD
### Base URL: http://localhost:8080/ex51/books
### ============================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/ex51/books


### 01 - Create book: Dune - 201 Created
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Dune",
    "author": "Frank Herbert",
    "theme": "SCIENCE_FICTION",
    "year": 1965,
    "price": 19.99,
    "notes": "Science fiction classic."
}


