### ADDITIONAL DELETE TESTS
### Create the books below before testing DELETE by ID/details.
### ============================================================


### 52 - Create book for DELETE by ID - 201 Created
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Neuromancer",
    "author": "William Gibson",
    "theme": "SCIENCE_FICTION",
    "year": 1984,
    "price": 18.50,
    "notes": "Book for deletion by ID."
}


### 53 - Delete Neuromancer by ID - 200 OK
### Assumes requests 01-05 and 52 were the only successful creations.
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/6


### 54 - Create book for DELETE by details - 201 Created
